#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:130
msgid "Added sounds for banking points in Farkle, reaching exactly 33 or 66 in 99, and declaring a marriage in Tysiac."
msgstr ""

#: lib/game_room_changelog.rb:277
msgid "Added statistics by balteam: visits, started and completed games, with game and period filters. Open Statistics in the main menu. Ctrl+W on that menu's options list reads current public and private table counts and human memberships, including observers but not bots. Developer mode does not collect new statistics."
